      "criterion": "visible_prompt_rubric_alignment",
      "details": "Actual independent content review by /root/lesson_content_review_2; report SHA256 cb8d6b0d43665af39b8757f456bc312c08152c5ac895d2e21e6047a015afeac4; original target dinner_plan_transfer.criteria[focus-distinction]. Owner acceptance does not resolve this advisory.",
      "excerpt": "Bruk både «få til» og «klare å».",
      "explanation": "The visible gardening prompt asks for both expressions but never assigns fa til to sprouting and klare a to planting. Its hidden judge requires precisely that assignment and rejects the reverse even while acknowledging both expressions can naturally describe either event. A response foregrounding the writer's effort getting seeds to sprout and the achieved result of planting before the holiday can meet the visible facts and both-expression instruction yet fail.",
